==Battleground==
*3 [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Olga (Enemy)|Olga]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Norn (Enemy)|Norns]] spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Yoichi (Enemy)|Yoichi]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**4 [[Norn (Enemy)|Norns]] spawn, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

